### Architecture
- No auth (manager + candidate pages fully public)
- SQLite via better-sqlite3 (local only, not prod-ready)
- OpenRouter free models for caller simulation + evaluation
- Deterministic ticket scoring (regex-based) + AI checkpoint scoring
- Single seeded scenario + criteria version

